
### Create a new campus event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Campus Technology Expo",
  "description": "A showcase of student technology projects.",
  "location": "Main Campus",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-20T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}



### Get the newly created event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/evt-1794574066556


### Test invalid event data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "An event without a title.",
  "location": "Main Campus",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-20T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}
